# Four typical mistakes, the same four as the hand-written BlueSky file
# bluesky/four_mistakes.scn. Written to be rejected: it exits 1.
#
# The first compile reports the undeclared callsign AI220 (line 14) and stops.
# Change AI220 to AI202 and compile again to see the other three: heading 450,
# speed 40 kt, and a climb and a descent with no advance between them.
scenario "Four mistakes"
fix VOMAN 12.95 77.67
flight AI202 type A320 enter VOMAN alt FL240 hdg 090 spd 280KT
advance 10
clear AI202 heading 450
clear AI202 speed 40KT
advance 10
clear AI220 climb FL300
advance 10
clear AI202 climb FL320
clear AI202 descend FL280
advance 10
